# finish/glint: the edge spark (STYLE_P2 27.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 6b `fx glint`; LADDER-FINISH, ladder polish i1): a four-point
# star in three frames, drawn by the view OPAQUE in the piece's Glow ramp (2 saturated, 3 pale, 4 white) on the
# grip-to-tip line. Polish i1 (the panel: "invisible at game scale"): a1 (5x5 diamond: a white core in a pale body, the
# spark gathering) the first 25 % of the run, a2 (7x7: the white core, a pale 3x3 heart, long arms tapering to saturated
# tips) the middle, a3 (3x3, dimmer) at the tip; a2 alone flashes on the strike's impact frame. Identical in every facing.
